  'Sustainable Tourism on Kenya''s Coast: How We''re Making a Difference',
  'sustainable-tourism-kenya-coast',
  'Learn about our commitment to sustainable tourism and how your stay contributes to environmental conservation and local community development.',
  E'# Sustainable Tourism on Kenya''s Coast: How We''re Making a Difference\n\nAt Villa Horizon, we believe that tourism should benefit both visitors and local communities while protecting the natural environment that makes Kenya''s coast so special.\n\n## Our Environmental Commitments\n\n### Beach Conservation\nWe organize monthly beach cleanups involving guests, staff, and local community members. Our properties use biodegradable products and have implemented waste reduction programs.\n\n### Marine Protection\nWe support coral reef conservation projects and educate guests about responsible snorkeling and diving practices. All our water activities follow strict environmental guidelines.\n\n### Energy Efficiency\nMany of our properties use solar power and energy-efficient appliances. We''ve reduced plastic usage by 80% across all our accommodations.\n\n## Community Development\n\n### Local Employment\nWe prioritize hiring from local communities, providing training and fair wages. Over 90% of our staff are from nearby villages.\n\n### Cultural Preservation\nWe work with local artisans and cultural groups, offering guests authentic experiences while supporting traditional crafts and practices.\n\n### Education Support\nA portion of every booking goes to local schools and educational programs, helping children in coastal communities access quality education.\n\n## How You Can Help\n\n- Choose eco-friendly accommodations\n- Support local businesses and artisans\n- Respect wildlife and marine life\n- Minimize plastic usage\n- Participate in community activities\n- Leave only footprints, take only photographs\n\n## Real Impact\n\nLast year alone, our collective efforts resulted in:\n- 5 tons of plastic removed from beaches\n- 200 coral transplants\n- 150 local jobs created\n- 50 students sponsored through school\n\nYour choice to book with us makes a real difference.',
  'Sustainability',
  ARRAY['Sustainability', 'Conservation', 'Community', 'Eco-Tourism'],
  'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1559827260-dc66d52bef19?w=1200&q=80',
  '32e08686-e22b-4947-8615-d2c76caa053f',
  true,
